<?xml version="1.0"?>
<config xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
        xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="urn:magento:module:Magento_Config:etc/system_file.xsd">
    <system>
        <tab id="commercekings" translate="label" sortOrder="900" class="commercekings-tab">
            <label>CommerceKings</label>
        </tab>
        <section id="commercekings_abandoned_cart" translate="label" sortOrder="40" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
            <label>Abandoned Cart</label>
            <tab>commercekings</tab>
            <resource>CommerceKings_AbandonedCart::config</resource>
            <group id="general" translate="label comment" sortOrder="10" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                <label>Cart reminder</label>
                <comment><![CDATA[One reminder email for carts left untouched - only with consent for purpose cart_reminder (Stores > Configuration > CommerceKings > Consent; guests: email typed in checkout, customers: account email). Cron finds the carts, a RabbitMQ consumer (commerceKingsAbandonedCartRemind) sends the emails. See the module README.md.]]></comment>
                <field id="enabled" translate="label" type="select" sortOrder="10" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Enabled</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                </field>
                <field id="delay_minutes" translate="label comment" type="text" sortOrder="20" showInDefault="1">
                    <label>Send after (minutes untouched)</label>
                    <comment>180 = 3 hours. Use 1-2 minutes for testing.</comment>
                    <validate>validate-digits validate-greater-than-zero</validate>
                </field>
                <field id="quote_lifetime" translate="label comment" type="label" sortOrder="30" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Magento quote lifetime (read-only)</label>
                    <frontend_model>CommerceKings\AbandonedCart\Block\Adminhtml\System\Config\QuoteLifetime</frontend_model>
                    <comment>Inherited from Sales &gt; Checkout &gt; Shopping Cart &gt; Quote Lifetime (days). Measured from the cart's last update. Restore links work for up to seven days after sending, while the quote remains unexpired.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="reminders_per_cart" translate="label comment" type="label" sortOrder="35" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Reminders per cart (read-only)</label>
                    <frontend_model>CommerceKings\AbandonedCart\Block\Adminhtml\System\Config\ReminderPolicy</frontend_model>
                    <comment>Defined by the delivery policy in code. Distinct eligible carts using the same email address can each receive a reminder.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="template" translate="label" type="select" sortOrder="40" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Email template</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Email\Template</source_model>
                </field>
                <field id="identity" translate="label" type="select" sortOrder="50" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Sender</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Email\Identity</source_model>
                </field>
            </group>
        </section>
    </system>
</config>
